        <p class="hint">支持 ${_d(a0_0x545764(0x1e0e,'\x29\x6a\x76\x71')+a0_0x545764(0x231,'\x62\x65\x5d\x4b'))}://（可带 user:pass@）、http(s)://、${_d(a0_0x545764(0x39e6,'\x40\x58\x4f\x67')+a0_0x545764(0xcb2,'\x52\x26\x41\x79'))} 或 host:port（默认按 ${_d('\x63\x32\x39\x6a\x61'+a0_0x545764(0x2de2,'\x26\x6a\x56\x53'))}，端口 1080）。此项控制 Worker 的真实转发出口，不会作为节点字段写进订阅；验证出口 IP 时请选择“仅走出口（only）”，默认模式在代理失败时会回退直连。SS 加密支持 ${_d('\x59\x57\x56\x7a\x4c'+a0_0x545764(0x40e1,'\x23\x49\x26\x41')+a0_0x545764(0x2b58,'\x61\x59\x5e\x5d')+'\x3d')} / ${_d('\x59\x57\x56\x7a\x4c'+'\x54\x49\x31\x4e\x69'+'\x31\x6e\x59\x32\x30'+'\x3d')} / ${_d(a0_0x545764(0xfc6,'\x71\x44\x57\x56')+a0_0x545764(0x3ce9,'\x4f\x71\x28\x25')+'\x41\x3d')}-ietf-poly1305。</p>
